            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naarai inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Koany, ayauni Nebukadaresar ekabaka loko Babulon, ekabaka loka ikabakan, anyoun kagolitomei, asurokin Turo, ejaas kibalasin, ka agalin, ka ikebwanenok, ka ajore, ka ituŋa da luipu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
