            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.20.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 20:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 52:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.21.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esk 21:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eari apesurukon nuejaas orony kekileŋ: eduki arwatatin asurokinia, itutuei etut asurokinia, kikeikini eupal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibwaikini skutake nutiyanakinet arwatatinikon, ido ejepejepei cut abwasinikon kaepeike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirapari apua naka ibalasinike naarai ipu: ilokilokos arwatatinikon kanuka ecelet loka ikebwanenok, ka loka akokoron, ka loka agalin, naelomaria koruteikon, kwape elomariata ituŋa ore loebelitai arorwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipudapudai ikonirotin kere kimageger luka ibalasinike: eari ikonituŋa kekilen, ijesunos ipirin luka agogoŋukon kwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido enaŋete akonibar, emejaete lugwelanarakon: etiyatiyaete eut arwatatinikon, emudiarete itogoikon lukaisiyalamikina: ecakanakinete amorukon ka akitokon ka apuakon kidin akipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
